ical_business_count":5},{"category":"Sandwiches","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"UbFkHiEt9S-0mUL3RQ5Ghg","review_id":"h0bsRL7mbWo0bzS5Wf1eHA","date":"2017-10-10T01:57:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9445959329605103,"text_excerpt":"Turkey and the Wolf was packed when I got there, so we took the sandwiches to go. Sandwiches had excellent flavors and textures! Tried the fried bologna and lamb roti. Both sandwiches were decent portion sizes as well. Would come back to try the wedge salad. Hopefully they'll have some special sandwiches. The menu is creative and I'd like to see what else they come up with."},{"business_id":"UbFkHiEt9S-0mUL3RQ5Ghg","review_id":"xlcW5ruHMIdd8058fMyKTw","date":"2017-12-28T23:52:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9422353506088257,"text_excerpt":"A bit of a wait, but understandable as the restaurant is so well known at this point. We had the bologna and the lamb pita. We also got the wedge salad. I loved the lamb pita. Savory, yet refreshing with the cucumber and herbs, not too heavy. The wedge was great and perfect to split between the three of us. The everything bagel topping is a neat spin on it. My husband said the bologna was a lot to handle in one sandwich, but also tasty as hell. We had to grab a seat outside, as there was no seating space inside. The patio was a bit cozy and i could have used some more shading. The service was good considering how crazy busy they were. Loved the concept of the old, mismatched cups and such..."},{"business_id":"UbFkHiEt9S-0mUL3RQ5Ghg","review_id":"yVX_QumwCG5AOGtzQemh4g","date":"2017-08-01T16:43:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9415863752365112,"text_excerpt":"What an awesome food place! I had the fried bologna sandwich and it was so good! My fiance had the collard greens melt and that was also delicious - kinda tasted like a vegetarian Ruben sandwich. We took ours to-go but while waiting we saw some other orders come up that looked amazing. Mostly the salads. The presentation makes it look so delicious. I'm definitely trying a salad next time I go."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"UbFkHiEt9S-0mUL3RQ5Ghg","photo_id":"TmFhafmuEiN0O8zCAqPisQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/TmFhafmuEiN0O8zCAqPisQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.856977641582489},{"business_id":"UbFkHiEt9S-0mUL3RQ5Ghg","photo_id":"-X-Bt5lNI8OgPox_PeSCBw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/-X-Bt5lNI8OgPox_PeSCBw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8417646884918213},{"business_id":"UbFkHiEt9S-0mUL3RQ5Ghg","photo_id":"yodHFMj6ftSn4ryF_kDKoQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/yodHFM